OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club granted permission  
OL,4,Ato create fan zone                     
OL,6,FA non-league football club has been    
OL,7,Fgranted planning permission for a new  
OL,8,Ffan zone at its ground.                
OL,10,FHarborough Town asked for permission to
OL,11,Fimprove its facilities following its   
OL,12,Fpromotion to the National League North.
OL,14,FThe plans, which were approved by      
OL,15,FHarborough District Council on Monday  
OL,16,F23 November, will include food and     
OL,17,Fdrink serving areas, a club shop, a    
OL,18,Fstage for entertainment and television 
OL,19,Fscreens.                               
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
