OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club granted permission  
OL,4,Ato create fan zone                     
OL,6,FThe area, behind the clubhouse, will be
OL,7,Favailable on non-match days as a venue 
OL,8,Ffor "the local community to meet       
OL,9,Fsocially, watch live sporting events   
OL,10,Fand host other appropriate             
OL,11,Fcommunity-focused functions," planning 
OL,12,Fdocuments said.                        
